				\begin{document}$${p}_{{\text{normalized}}}=p\cdot{\text{log}}\left(p/{p}_{{\text{mean}}}\right)$$\end{document}pnormalized=p·logp/pmean. We then passed this to tfmodisco-lite (https://github.com/jmschrei/tfmodisco-lite) to obtain motifs.
